<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore total trade volume grows 0.2 pct in Q1.</title>
<headline>Singapore total trade volume grows 0.2 pct in Q1.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Singapore's volume of total trade grew 0.2 percent in the first quarter of 1997, the Ministry of Trade and Industry said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65) 870-3080</p>
